n it locally in minutes This is one of the most powerful open-source AI design tools right now… and it’s completely free. 🚀 ⏱️ Timestamps 0:00 - Introduction 0:39 - Claude Design Limitations 1:09 - Solution 2:12 - Output Quality 3:26 - How To Setup 5:00 - How To Use 8:00 - Demo 9:29 - Output 💡 Key Takeaways Open-source alternative to Claude Design Works with multiple AI models (not locked in) Generates real UI, decks, and design systems Local-first + deployable workflows Completely free to use 🚀 Subscribe for more AI tools, agents, and workflows! #AI #OpenDesign #ClaudeDesign #AItools #NoCode #WebDesign #AIDesign #Developers #Tech #ArtificialIntelligence</description>
